          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "/* 1) Give the webpage a background color */\n\n/* 2) Make all the images go to the right of the page */\n\n/* 3) Make all of the text a different color */\n\n/* 4) Add any other styles you want */",
